infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title One inner ORDER BY flips the frame
  desc Same SUM, same PARTITION BY region — adding ORDER BY inside OVER silently turns a flat total into a running one
  compares
    - label No inner ORDER BY
      children
        - label OVER (PARTITION BY region)
          desc The window with no inner sort
        - label Frame = entire partition
          desc Aggregates every row in the region
        - label Flat total, repeated
          desc Same value on every row of the region
        - label Use it for region totals
          desc What the revenue report actually wanted
    - label Inner ORDER BY
      children
        - label OVER (PARTITION BY region ORDER BY sale_date)
          desc The same window, now ordered
        - label Frame = UNBOUNDED PRECEDING to CURRENT ROW
          desc RANGE from partition start up to this row
        - label Running total, grows down
          desc Cumulative — changed with no error or warning
        - label Use it only when you want running
          desc Ranks, ROW_NUMBER, running sums
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
